   "rating": 4,
   "date": "2006-12-12T22:00:28-06:00",
   "body": "I turned in some necklaces 3 times today. I got my rep, but no exp bonus for me. Got an initial 3900xp for the first turn in, but there after just the rep.",
   "replies": []
