  {
   "rating": 4,
   "date": "2005-12-23T13:10:35-06:00",
   "body": "[b]Location:[/b]  Wildhammer Keep; 14.44 (To recieve and complete the quest).  Zun'watha; 23.58 (Trolls).  Hiri'watha; 31.57 (Trolls).\n\n[b]Description:[/b]  The levels are from 40-41 in Zun'watha and from 42-43 in Hiri'watha.  Basically any trolls found in The Hinterlands will drop the necklaces.  Pulls are fairly easy, especially with crowd control, but be careful.  Kill the trolls and they will randomly drop the necklaces.  Each troll kill will give you 5 points of reputation with the Wildhammer Clan.  This quest is repeatable.  However, you only recieve 390 experience and 27 points of reputation with the Wildhammer Clan when you repeat the quest.\n\n[b]Experience:[/b]  3900\n\n[b]Reputation:[/b]  110 points with the Wildhammer Clan\n\n[b]Character:[/b]  Level 49\n\n[b]Version:[/b]  1.8.4\n\nEdited, Fri Dec 23 06:50:27 2005",
   "replies": []
  },
